# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. `.env.local` is gitignored; this file is not,
# so it must never contain real values.
#
# Copernicus Marine (CMEMS) credentials, used by CopernicusGridClient to shell
# out to the `copernicusmarine` toolbox for the PFZ zone grid (SST, SST
# anomaly, chlorophyll, currents, bottom temperature, sea level).
#
# Both names work; the long ones are the documented CMEMS variables and take
# precedence. Without them the PFZ endpoints still answer, but return an empty
# zone set with a coverage note saying the corridor did not resolve, which is
# the correct degraded behaviour rather than an error.
#
# Account: register at https://data.marine.copernicus.eu/ (My Copernicus Profile
# -> API Access). An account is free; a service-account key is not needed.
# Rotate immediately if these are ever pasted into a commit, log, or chat.

COPERNICUSMARINE_SERVICE_USERNAME=
COPERNICUSMARINE_SERVICE_PASSWORD=